				Time="2011-07-20T07:02:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんな　バラバラな　連携じゃ
ぼくたちは　倒せないよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-25T08:58:39" />
