	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DL04M_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いい　しょうぶだったね！
かんきゃくも　もりあがってるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-25T08:10:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:05:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いい　勝負だったね！
観客も　盛り上がってるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-25T08:10:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
